# FINAL_RUN.md must stay current

[`FINAL_RUN.md`](FINAL_RUN.md) is the canonical command sheet for primary Table 1–4 runs.

## When editing matched files

In the **same** change set, update `FINAL_RUN.md` if any of the following drift:

- Protocol script modes, usage, or order (Table 1 before 2→3→4)
- Config paths / `run_id` / results directories
- Shared fair-DDAE knobs (`early_stop_patience`, `time_emb_dim`, seeds, epochs, val stop)
- Assert / smoke / Vast setup / sync / hardware tier commands
- Artifact paths (`completed.json`, thesis compare/gates)

Also bump the **Last updated** date at the top of `FINAL_RUN.md`.

## Do not

- Leave stale commands after renaming scripts or configs
- Document demoted hybrids (v2–v5.1 routed/GATE/merges) as primary final runs
- Skip updating `FINAL_RUN.md` because “README already mentions it”
